      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Output basics: name and write files from tokens.\n\n1. PD Project Context and PD Custom Context hold the shot details. Their values become tokens: {project}, {sequence}, {shot}, {version}, {user}, {task}.\n2. PD Output builds the path from its template and writes the image into ComfyUI's output folder, with a sidecar .json.\n3. PD Tokens To String turns the same tokens into text (for prompts, titles, other paths).\n\nRun it, then look at PD Output's token panel. Try version 002, auto_increment_version, or path_mode absolute with a network base_path."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Output basics: name and write files from tokens.\n\n1. PD Project Context and PD Custom Context hold the shot details. Their values become tokens: {project}, {sequence}, {shot}, {version}, {user}, {task}.\n2. PD Output builds the path from its template and writes the image into ComfyUI's output folder, with a sidecar .json.\n3. PD Tokens To String turns the same tokens into text (for prompts, titles, other paths).\n\nRun it, then look at PD Output's token panel. Try version 002, auto_increment_version, or path_mode absolute with a network base_path."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
